  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The brass bell of a clapper trap is so loud that tinkers test it with wax in their ears.</p><p>As an action, you can set this trap in an unoccupied space within reach. When a creature enters that space, the trap goes off: the creature that triggers it must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=11 format=long]] or it has the &amp;Reference[Deafened apply=false] condition for 10 rounds. The trap is then spent. A creature that spots it can disarm it with a [[/check ability=dex dc=11 format=long]].</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
